+terminator: its length, or -1 if it does not fit or the format has other
+conversions than %s, %c, %d, %u, %ld, %lu and %%, or flags, a width or a
+precision (which the translators seldom use). printf takes about a
+microsecond a call on the Cortex-A53, and a shader hundreds of calls */
+static long text_format(char *buffer, unsigned long size, const char *format, va_list arguments)
+{
+	unsigned long length = 0;
